'''Silver''' is a crafting material smelted from [[Silver Ore]] in a [[Smelter]] using [[Coal]] as fuel. Silver can also be obtained directly from destroying [[Ancient Pot]]s found in ruins and [[Putrid Hole]]s within the [[Ashlands]] biome.

==Usage==
===Crafting===
====[[Mountain]]====
*{{item link|Crystal Battleaxe}}
*{{item link|Drake Helmet}}
*{{item link|Draugr Fang}}
*{{item link|Fang Spear}}
*{{item link|Flesh Rippers}}
*{{item link|Frostner}}
*{{item link|Silver Arrow}}
